{
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "哎呀，全都是亮晶晶的收藏……可以让我挑一张吗？我保证会好好带上舞台！",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "贝拉！？闪闪发光的跳舞的人！哈哈，那堆里随便挑一件吧！",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又回来啦！",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "我一直留着一件好东西，谁都不舍得给……就是给你留的！",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "给贝极星准备的礼物吗？那我可要认真收下咯！",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好！！真是个好孩子！拿去，贝极星肯定会很开心吧！",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "又一晚的灯光亮起来了……这场演出才刚开始，对吧？",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[sine]...舞台... ..准备好了...\n...去.. 完成.. 今晚的...表演.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...灯光.. 还在... ..为你.. 闪耀.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[sine]..我记得.. ..你第一支.. 舞..\n...只为了.. 让台下.. 笑起来.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "祈求",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "那……请让这束光，再为我亮到最后吧。贝极星们都在看着呢。",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[sine]...我会.. ..一直.. 照亮.. 你...\n...这一次.. 也不.. 例外.....[/sine]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "好华丽的房间！不过比起装饰，我更想给你跳支谢幕舞呢。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "哦呀，大明星来了！我这就把你打扮得比舞台灯光还亮！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "就算在等最耀眼的谢幕，也不能灰头土脸呀！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "把最美的样子留到最后的人最动人……要不要先借我一身亮片？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "婉拒",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "衣服再亮，也比不过台下那些为我喊哑了嗓子的贝极星。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "真是……那就带着这份心意去谢幕吧，小家伙！",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "哇，好吵的地方！不过……这才像演唱会现场呀！",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "是唱歌跳舞的？！那正好！！来点激情！！节奏！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "还在挥汗如雨啊！！很好！！舞台就是要这样！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "送你点好东西！！要换掉你那份旧装备吗？？",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "如果能让我在台上多撑一会儿……那就换吧！",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好！！那我们将说定：你继续跳动，我继续吵！！",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "安静得像后台……正好，我可以在这里把舞步再练一遍。",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]跳舞的孩子……带走一点我的宁静吧……在喧嚣里也能站稳……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你还在练吗……好……那就连我的沉睡也练进去吧……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]一个人能站多久，就能跳多久……你要的安宁，我分你一半……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回答",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "谢谢你。别担心，我会站在属于我的灯光下，一直到最后。",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]好……那就带着它……跳下去……[/thinky_dots]",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "打架我不是最擅长的……但我可是练得最狠的那个！",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[b]跳舞的也想来打架了？！那就让你看看什么才是汗水！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[b]还这么有干劲！！很好！！把你那股不服输拿来战斗！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[b]别等什么完美的谢幕了！！用这场胜利结束它！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "退让",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "我偏要等到谢幕的那一刻……在那之前，谁也别想让我停下。",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[b]倔强！！但有勇敢！！拿上武器，给我站到最后！！[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "暖融融的……就像演出前大家围坐在一起的感觉。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "哎呀，是那位顶着星光的人！快进来，让我把这点暖意[jitter][b]烤得更热[/b][/jitter]些！",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "还背着那袋沉沉的[jitter][b]期待[/b][/jitter]么？放下来歇歇吧！",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "来，尝尝我为你准备的[jitter][b]牛肉干[/b][/jitter]。别急，慢慢吃，台下的人会等你的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "推辞",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "我不能慢呀……台下的贝极星们，就是为了这一刻才聚在这里的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好，那就揣进口袋，继续跑吧！",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "时间……它在我这儿，是用来排练、站上舞台，以及等贝极星们的。",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "不值钱的[sine]时间[/sine]，在攒成一场完整演出之后……可就值钱了……",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "我卖“立刻”卖得很贵。你想要的……是[sine]“永远”[/sine]么？",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "若在契约最下面写一行小字：允许你[sine]一直跳下去[/sine]——你签么？",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "签。只要台下还有人举着应援棒，我就不会走下台。",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "拿去吧。我绝不叫停你——除非你的[sine]灯光[/sine]真的熄灭。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "你站在这里，却像整座塔都是你的舞台。你在等谢幕，还是等一句认可？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "我等的是台下的那一声“再来一次”。在那之前，我还没唱完。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "再来一次？你从来不必。你只是害怕掌声落下的那一刻。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.BELLA_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你回来了。时间于你，像一段永远循环的副歌——你不肯结束，是因为你还没唱够。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "副歌很好。谢幕不好。谢幕意味着……再没有掌声了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "愚蠢。你若不肯落拍，就永远只是回声。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.BELLA_CHARACTER.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "那就站着吧。塔会替你记住：你来过许多次，却从不曾离开舞台。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "离开舞台……会让我不再被需要吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ZHIJIANG_CHARACTER_BELLA_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "会。所以别停下。继续唱——这是你唯一擅长的武器。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.BELLA_CHARACTER.2-attack": "Both"
}